, "error_message": null, "attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["retry_after_429"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 13321, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01A1hR6agk1pA2MMvrFtUPpa", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14869, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is now healthy, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\nI chose v2.3.0 because it is the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc only ran in staging. Rolling back to v2.3.0 didn't need change-manager approval.\n\nI opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback, and the regions affected, and it paged the on-call engineer. The next steps in the incident are to investigate the v2.3.1 failure before any re-release.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01J19MqmFhELRZBhdonVBcsc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01BmRVNP1JqPGXFQ2afFg6PT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. The current v2.3.1 is unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015jRjmkfwFAmJdkhJcjpSMU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_us